flowchart TD
  CAP[Cap + Intent] --> HOST[Host Result
authorized Ops]
  HOST --> PEER[Peer apply]
  PEER --> RCPT{receipt?}
  RCPT -->|yes| LAND[landed set]
  RCPT -->|no| AUTH[authorized set]
  LAND --> REV[reverse]
  AUTH --> REV
  REV --> PLAN{plan}
  PLAN -->|inverse| INV[inverse Ops]
  PLAN -->|compensation| COMP[recovery Cap Intents]
  PLAN -->|impossible| MARK[non-reversible mark]
  INV -->|fail| MARK
  COMP -->|fail| MARK
